  "excerpt": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Why Intellectual Property is important for Academia?”</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru has organized a webinar on the topic “Why Intellectual Property is important for Academia?” in association with Institutions Innovation Council on 30th July 2021. Dr. Nithin K S, Assistant Professor and Co-Ordinator, Centre for Research and Development, Department of Chemistry, NIE, Mysuru was the resource person for the webinar. Dr. Nithin K S, shared about the concepts of Intellectual Property, its types and importance in academia in detail through the Webinar.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
